-01", "chunk_id": "c003", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r003", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第三节 开通申请与审批"], "token_count": 228, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 444.1171875, 168.75, 455.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 470.9765625, 546.75, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 560.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第三节 开通申请与审批\n\n在IT服务台提交企业VPN开通申请，填写企业账号、所属业务和访问原因。申请中可以写明需要访问的内部系统，但不要因此认为对应系统的角色会同步授予。服务台根据申请执行审核与开通，审批通过后方可按通知使用。\n\n申请提交、申请获批和实际开通是不同状态。尚未收到开通结果时，不应反复尝试其他人的账号。申请被退回时，应根据缺失项补充真实业务说明；", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 3.80702, "vector_score": 0.193917}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c006", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r006", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第六节 验证码与时间"], "token_count": 210, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 305.6171875, 157.25, 317.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 332.4765625, 541.5, 360.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 376.4765625, 541.5, 404.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六节 验证码与时间\n\n出现验证码无效时，先检查验证码是否已过期、是否误输入空格以及设备时间是否明显偏差，再使用本人当前有效的验证码重试。不要连续转发截图寻求他人代填，也不要把验证码写进工单附件。\n\n动态验证码与企业账号密码是不同信息。本文未规定验证码的具体有效秒数、补发次数和锁定阈值；如果提示账号锁定或验证方式不可用，应联系IT服务台，不能按猜测次数持续尝", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.700524, "vector_score": 0.255492}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十四节 沟通与状态确认"], "token_count": 234, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 340.6171875, 180.25, 352.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 367.4765625, 541.5, 412.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 428.9765625, 541.5, 456.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十四节 沟通与状态确认\n\n服务台可能要求补充可公开给处理人员的错误信息。申请人应通过原工单补充，保留处理记录，避免多个渠道出现相互矛盾的描述。恢复后可以记录恢复时间及最后一次操作，但没有验证因果关系时，不应断言某项操作必然解决问题。\n\n问题已受理、处理中和已恢复是不同状态。本文没有承诺服务台响应时限、故障恢复时间或补偿规则。需要紧急访问时，应请求业务负责人", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.672646, "vector_score": 0.222202}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c044", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r044", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第七条 场景问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 461.6171875, 134.25, 473.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 488.4765625, 546.75, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 546.75, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七条 场景问答\n\n问：成都会展期间房价涨到500元，能直接按500元报吗？答：表A中成都限额为350元，T08续行说明会展涨价不自动提高额度；超标须事先取得部门负责人书面批准，并在报销时附批准记录。应结合第2页、第3页和第5页共同注释阅读。\n\n问：上海一晚实际支付420元，可以按500元申请吗？答：不能按未发生的差额申报，500元是限额。问：未列出的国内城", "rrf_score": 0.015385, "bm25_score": 3.524947, "vector_score": 0.301234}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 186.0, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围\n\n员工在公司外访问内部系统时，需要使用企业VPN。企业VPN用于建立访问内部资源所需的网络连接；连接成功不代表自动获得每个系统的业务权限。用户仍需满足目标系统的账号、角色与授权要求。本文仅适用于企业员工的接入流程。\n\n本指南不规定个人设备准入、海外网络接入、承包商访问或其他远程访问产品的使用办法。若使用环境属于上述情况，应补充相", "rrf_score": 0.015152, "bm25_score": 1.741889, "vector_score": 0.224209}]}}
