f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 4, "bbox": [245.0, 461.5, 547.0, 492.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "T23 | 无锡 | 国内出差 | 350 | 会议打包价格需说明住宿部分；没有明细时不得自行猜测费用拆分比例。", "rrf_score": 0.016393, "bm25_score": 3.854911, "vector_score": 0.379877}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c010", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r010", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十条金额不一致"], "token_count": 198, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 306.8377197265625, 145.0928955078125, 318.29638671875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9993941634893417}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 331.45263671875, 540.185498046875, 362.00908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.991314462489552}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 375.16533203125, 546.953662109375, 406.5705810546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984027472409335}], "snippet": "第十条金额不一致\n\n实际支付金额与发票金额不同的，应说明优惠、退款、预付款、个人承担或其他原因，并提供对应材料。申请金额应能够沿记录追溯到实际承担费用，不能只给出一个没有分项依据的总额。\n\n合并多张单据时，应列出每张凭据的金额和用途；拆分一张单据到多个项目时，应记录分配方式和关联单号。本文不规定统一分摊公式，不得以便于计算为由把任意比例当成公司制度。", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 2.724803, "vector_score": 0.392036}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十三条 代付与分摊示例"], "token_count": 222, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 180.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十三条 代付与分摊示例\n\n员工甲为同一项目的三名成员代付交通费用时，应在申请中列出同行人员、出行事项、实际支付金额和分摊说明。同行人员不应再次按相同凭据申报。若部分行程属于个人安排，应明确个人承担部分，不能将其隐藏在项目合计金额中。\n\n一个订单含两个项目的支出时，应说明分摊口径并由相应业务负责人确认。本文未规定必须按人数、时间或项目预算比例分摊，不能为了方", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 2.551182, "vector_score": 0.39482}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第二条 城市分类与费用口径"], "token_count": 235, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 305.6171875, 191.75, 317.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 332.4765625, 546.75, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第二条 城市分类与费用口径\n\n本合成制度将北京、上海、广州和深圳列为一线城市，其余表列城市及未列明的其他国内城市按350元标准执行。城市分类仅用于本资料内部规则，不代表外部统计口径；不能因为当地商业活动多或酒店价格高而自行变更分类。\n\n住宿费应以实际发生并有凭据支持的金额申请。低于限额时，不得按限额填报未实际发生的差额；高于限额时，应按事先书面批准要求准备材", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 2.478299, "vector_score": 0.398211}]}}
